     "body": "<p>Closing as out of scope. This is easy to implement in a servlet container or a reverse proxy. For example, here is a possible Nginx configuration:</p>\n\n<p>gzip on;<br/>\ngzip_types text/javascript text/turtle application/json application/ld+json application/rdf+xml application/n-triples;<br/>\ngzip_proxied no-cache auth;</p>",
